66:     * as it stood on the day being left is audited first, in list order, and kept as one of their snapshot lines, and the sheet as it stood at
67:     * the end of that day is kept (see {@link TodayLeaving}). The periods it puts past their grace
68:     * days are closed (see {@link TodayChanged}) before those figures are audited.
69:     */
70:    @Transactional
